0..77 Comment "//! A peer that has sent everything before its scope abandons the rest leaves"
78..110 Comment "//! the run its clause\'s answer."
111..114 Comment "//!"
115..192 Comment "//! The run\'s scheduler starts a fork\'s child when the root first waits. Here"
193..266 Comment "//! the child sends both payloads and ends before the clause abandons the"
267..283 Comment "//! root\'s rest."
284..287 Comment "//!"
288..365 Comment "//! The root takes the first payload, then the exit abandons its continuation"
366..443 Comment "//! with the second payload still on the channel. No cancellation reaches the"
444..483 Comment "//! ended peer, so the run answers `7`."
484..487 Comment "//!"
488..564 Comment "//! - see: #3305 — the cancellation hop, which a peer still waiting at the"
565..588 Comment "//!   abandonment needs"
589..671 Comment "//! - cites: [Fowler-2019-exceptional_asynchronous_session_types] — cancellation"
672..695 Comment "//!   reaching the peer"
696..699 Comment "//!"
700..866 Comment "//! [Fowler-2019-exceptional_asynchronous_session_types]: https://doi.org/10.1145/3290341 \"Fowler, Lindley, Morris and Decova, Exceptional Asynchronous Session Types\""
868..899 Comment "// Early exit\'s host interface."
